WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,110
Which high-end family does Pan belong to?

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:04,110
Since my sister knows this

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,110
Why don't you make it clearer?

4
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:08,110
To avoid misunderstanding

5
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:10,110
I just heard it by chance

6
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:12,110
I can’t remember exactly whose family it is.

7
00:00:12,110 --> 00:00:15,840
It’s not Song, right?

8
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,840
That's good

9
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,870
Since you're not talking about me, that's fine

10
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:21,870
After all, my marriage to my husband

11
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,870
