12
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:25,870
If someone dares to talk behind my back,

13
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,870
My husband will definitely not kiss or spare her.

14
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,870
Sister's mouth

15
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,870
You have to take care of your words and deeds

16
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:35,280
My sister is serious

17
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:37,280
Second aunt told you that you are young

18
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:40,590
How could I care about you?

19
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:43,590
Did you do it on purpose?

20
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,590
My husband picked out fish bones for me in public

21
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,850
Are you trying to establish your authority for me?

22
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:48,850
tell them

23
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:51,850
No one can bully your people
